    "title": "namespace2xml - deterministic configuration transformer.",
    "version": "3.0.0-preview.4",
    "description": "Deterministic configuration transformer. Merges and templates namespace profiles into XML, JSON, YAML, INI and shell outputs from a single normative specification. Every diagnostic carries a stable code and a specification anchor, and --diagnostics-format json makes the whole diagnostic stream machine-readable for automation and AI agents."
  },
