    "helpDocumentCount": 1,
    "cliParsedDescription": "Reads ordered namespace profiles, JSON, YAML and XML inputs, applies scheme\ndirectives, and renders namespace, shell-quoted namespace, JSON, YAML, XML and\nINI outputs. Identical inputs always produce byte-identical outputs."
